OL,3,AAfrican Miss Universe beauty queens in
OL,4,Alimbo as US visa restrictions bite
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiss Universe Zimbabwe Roseanna Hall
OL,7,Fand several other contestants from
OL,8,FAfrica could miss this year's
OL,9,Fcompetition in Puerto Rico as they race
OL,10,Fto secure a US visa.
OL,12,FHall is due to represent Zimbabwe at
OL,13,Fthe 75th edition of the Miss Universe
OL,14,Fpageant, with the winner set to be
OL,15,Fcrowned on 24 November. But she has yet
OL,16,Fto obtain a visa to travel to the US
OL,17,Fterritory.
OL,19,F"We have been back and forth, trying to
OL,20,Fget my visa approved," Hall said in a
OL,21,Fvideo posted on her Instagram page.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
