OL,3,AAfrican Miss Universe beauty queens in
OL,4,Alimbo as US visa restrictions bite
OL,5,
OL,6,FHall is not the only African contestant
OL,7,Fto be affected by the restrictions.
OL,8,FZambia has withdrawn its
OL,9,Frepresentative, Pamela Mubanga, from
OL,10,Fthe competition because of US travel
OL,11,Frestrictions.
